    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Murmurs of Fear</strong> is an episodic psychological horror game, where each episode tells the story of someone who came face to face with something unexplainable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story about saving the world. It\u2019s about those who tried to keep their sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/b83619e2d6ac77d35f02ab006a3b1b89.avif?t=1754977739\" width=618 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Whisper of Loneliness \u2014 Episode One</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Alex, a 22-year-old electrician sent to a remote island with a lighthouse. A group of geologists had been working there, preparing to reopen the old, sealed mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, suddenly \u2014 all communication stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive alone. Greeted by fog, a storm, the distant lighthouse... and silence. No people. Empty homes. Scattered notes.<br>And something watching you through the mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have are your tools, a kerosene lamp, and the growing sense that you're <strong>not alone</strong> here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/5c3c91018e93ea73a593bb26d3ced78d.avif?t=1754977739\" width=618 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Lovecraftian silence \u2014 ancient symbols, forgotten obelisks, and whispers from the dark.<br>\ud83c\udfa5 Retro aesthetic \u2014 subtle VHS-style visuals without overkill.<br>\ud83d\udd0d Non-linear storytelling \u2014 discover clues, decide who or what to believe.<br>\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f Immersive atmosphere \u2014 foggy forests, creaking wood, and rare but powerful sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/3e69fb6ab0c978528cbf043c40f4016f.avif?t=1754977739\" width=618 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this episode, you will:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a desolate island and its eerie locations: docks, lighthouse, mines, and sawmill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles tied into the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use items to restore power and communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a minecart to travel across the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that lead to different endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/de36bd239d427e2c0fa4fb437c87c62c.avif?t=1754977739\" width=618 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive the night and uncover the truth that drove others mad?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you become just another whisper in the mist? </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Murmurs of Fear</strong> is an episodic psychological horror game, where each episode tells the story of someone who came face to face with something unexplainable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a story about saving the world. It\u2019s about those who tried to keep their sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/b83619e2d6ac77d35f02ab006a3b1b89.avif?t=1754977739\" width=618 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Whisper of Loneliness \u2014 Episode One</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Alex, a 22-year-old electrician sent to a remote island with a lighthouse. A group of geologists had been working there, preparing to reopen the old, sealed mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, suddenly \u2014 all communication stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive alone. Greeted by fog, a storm, the distant lighthouse... and silence. No people. Empty homes. Scattered notes.<br>And something watching you through the mist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you have are your tools, a kerosene lamp, and the growing sense that you're <strong>not alone</strong> here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/5c3c91018e93ea73a593bb26d3ced78d.avif?t=1754977739\" width=618 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd0d Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Lovecraftian silence \u2014 ancient symbols, forgotten obelisks, and whispers from the dark.<br>\ud83c\udfa5 Retro aesthetic \u2014 subtle VHS-style visuals without overkill.<br>\ud83d\udd0d Non-linear storytelling \u2014 discover clues, decide who or what to believe.<br>\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f Immersive atmosphere \u2014 foggy forests, creaking wood, and rare but powerful sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/3e69fb6ab0c978528cbf043c40f4016f.avif?t=1754977739\" width=618 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this episode, you will:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a desolate island and its eerie locations: docks, lighthouse, mines, and sawmill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles tied into the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and use items to restore power and communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a minecart to travel across the island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that lead to different endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129900/extras/de36bd239d427e2c0fa4fb437c87c62c.avif?t=1754977739\" width=618 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you survive the night and uncover the truth that drove others mad?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you become just another whisper in the mist? </p>",
    "short_description": "Murmurs of Fear is an episodic psychological horror about those left alone with the unexplainable. Each episode tells a self-contained story of fear, isolation, and the struggle to stay sane when the world around you begins to fracture.",
